  <item>
    <title>#21 串台 | musical.ly如何成为TikTok：与潘乱回顾收购前后那几年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f04be2b973c3fd59982969</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f04be2b973c3fd59982969</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 06:31:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是与乱翻书（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e9cc161d989496e752d932" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e9cc161d989496e752d932"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a><span>）节目的串台。我只改掉了片头，换成了musical.ly当年开屏的音乐Forever Young。</span></p><p><strong><span>【如何从多产品收敛到TikTok】</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 字节海外的“全家桶”时代</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>2017年入职musical.ly ，“字节一年，人间三年！”</span></p></li><li><p><span>先行者不一定能撑到最后，就变成先烈了。</span></p></li><li><p><span>主要竞品</span></p></li><li><p><a href="http://musical.ly" data-url="http://musical.ly"><span>musical.ly</span></a><span>与TikTok名字由来</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 短视频市场海外争夺</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>西瓜对标YouTube、火山对标快手、</span><a href="http://抖音对标musical.ly"><span>抖音对标musical.ly</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>白T与黑T</span></p></li><li><p><span>2018年8月，</span><a href="http://musical.ly" data-url="http://musical.ly"><span>musical.ly</span></a><span>与TikTok正式合体</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> </span></em></strong><a href="http://为什么收购musical.ly"><strong><em><span>为什么收购musical.ly</span></em></strong></a><strong><em><span>？</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>收购Flipagram对于字节跳动的全球化，意味着什么？</span></p></li><li><p><a href="http://推荐算法对musical.ly"><span>推荐算法对musical.ly</span></a><span>的改变</span></p></li><li><p><span>“没有你对我很重要”，不能让快手拿去。</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 从“独立运营”到品牌消亡</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>审核</span></p></li></ul><ul><li><p><span>算法应该有价值观吗？</span></p></li><li><p><span>数据作为唯一的真理的时候，它可以减少很多摩擦</span></p></li><li><p><span>A/B Test文化差异</span></p></li><li><p><a href="http://一夜之间musical.ly"><span>一夜之间musical.ly</span></a><span> 变成 TikTok ，用户什么反应？团队什么感受？</span></p></li><li><p><span>音轨复用，大幅降低了创作的门槛</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4037">01:07:17</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> </span></em></strong><a href="http://收购musical.ly"><strong><em><span>收购musical.ly</span></em></strong></a><strong><em><span>带来的负资产</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>低年龄和收购申报问题</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4249">01:10:49</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 竞争和心态变化</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>对巨头的认知演变 —— 从敬畏到平视，对Facebook祛魅了</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>【字节跳动的产品文化 —— </span></strong><a href="http://一个musical.ly"><strong><span>一个musical.ly</span></strong></a><strong><span>前员工的体感】</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4644">01:17:24</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 牛奶兑红茶——两套品味文化的碰撞与融合</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><a href="http://musical.ly" data-url="http://musical.ly"><span>musical.ly</span></a><span>像牛奶，字节像红茶，各有各的味道，合并之后变成了奶茶。</span></p></li><li><p><span>张楠（Kelly）：艺术生不是她的全部</span></p></li><li><p><span>Alex（朱骏）的“仙风道骨”怎么与字节的“大力出奇迹”共处？</span></p></li><li><p><span>卷卷（任利锋）</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6170">01:42:50</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 字节的产品决策机器怎么运转？</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>7 个小时的评审会，到底在争论什么？</span></p></li><li><p><span>怎么平衡“全球一致性”和“本地差异化”？</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6459">01:47:39</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 字节PM的工作方法与成长路径</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>字节PM的日常，大小周、双月OKR</span></p></li><li><p><span>“所有业务都想在feed里插卡片，加锚点，加底部信息条”</span></p></li><li><p><span>把自己带入到用户的视角</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6800">01:53:20</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 创新的窘境——字节的理性机器能不能长出“非共识”？</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>字节真的是一家“冷酷理性”的公司吗？</span></p></li><li><p><span>字节更愿意选择最后被验证的东西，再用它的方式更高效的做一遍</span></p></li><li><p><span>TikTok的愿景是什么？</span></p></li><li><p><span>产品是个容器，容器可以非常统一，但里面的内容不一样</span></p></li><li><p><span>双列给人一种虚幻的掌控感，仿佛我可以挑选，但实际上你依然是被算法推着走的</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>【如何克服海外水土不服】</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8762">02:26:02</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 当“大力出奇迹”撞上“文化防火墙”</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>在TikTok onboarding体验上，怎么做实验和验证？</span></p></li><li><p><span>“Cringy” —— 从被点评为“尴尬、辣眼睛”，到后来成为流行趋势的发起方</span></p></li><li><p><span>怎么通过产品侧的创新来提升新用户留存？</span></p></li><li><p><span>为什么字节能征服海外？</span></p></li><li><p><span>因为技术和推荐系统可以通用，配上一定的运营本地化。杯子都是一样的，饮料是不一样的。</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9578">02:39:38</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> 用人思路的反复 —— 到底用中国人还是外国人？</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>musical.ly/TikTok招团队的时候，筛选逻辑</span></p></li><li><p><span>给海外在地外国人团队极高自主权，这个信任边界是怎么建立的？</span></p></li><li><p><span>跨国协作中最大的挑战</span></p></li><li><p><span>疫情对于TikTok是有史以来最大的发展助推剂 —— 但它也是黑天鹅，没有人预料到。</span></p></li><li><p><span>TikTok只是抖音的时光机吗？有没有什么自己更先验证的原创性的东西？</span></p></li><li><p><span>TikTok更像社区，还是更偏社交？</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11251">03:07:31</a></span></em></strong><strong><em><span> &nbsp;</span></em></strong><a href="http://musical.ly" data-url="http://musical.ly"><strong><em><span>musical.ly</span></em></strong></a><strong><em><span>的遗产与TikTok的未来</span></em></strong></p><ul><li><p><a href="http://musical.ly" data-url="http://musical.ly"><span>musical.ly</span></a><span>消失了，但它留下了什么？</span></p></li><li><p><span>现在这杯“奶茶”里，还有多少“牛奶”的成分？</span></p></li><li><p><span>2024年，重新回到八号桥，在字节八年之后，你觉得自己变了吗？</span></p></li><li><p><span>认知领先和知行合一——说起来都很容易，实际上呢？</span></p></li><li><p><span>“下次多聊点 AI 吧。”</span></p></li></ul><p><span>{音乐} Alphaville - Forever Young</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/60be31b4bc8d30d2fa8b33e5/lo84nTP2WkgaVbla6fxBWl9TIq3X.m4a" length="191939313" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>03:17:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpRaFeUJxmsvbaoB1C0tly7krHA2"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>#20 播客听众过节啦：本来新年发，结果拖到愚人节……也是节吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69cd3609e2c8be315523d2ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cd3609e2c8be315523d2ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 15:21:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目从去年12月开始，拖到今年第一季度结束（此处应该有一个流汗黄豆脸）……</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道你们有没有过本来不忙，但为了填满这个“不忙”而让自己忙得要死的经历，26年对我来说就是这样。不管是社交放松，兴趣爱好还是副业项目，都有一种轮番上阵，应接不暇的感觉。所以这期播客确实出晚了，非常抱歉。给参与的主播朋友和听众朋友们鞠躬🙇。其中，冲浪商店应我的邀请出了一期节目，他们今年2月14日发的，在情人节，我本来打算元旦或者春节发，最终这期在4月1日发……嗯，怎么不算过节呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位去相应时间戳找喜爱的主播的答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 鹿鹿鱼鱼 的 郦橙锦妖Vanessa</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>作为主播，喜欢这几期：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60be31b4bc8d30d2fa8b33e6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60be31b4bc8d30d2fa8b33e6"><span>探探</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6590357720d779b49d1f1685" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6590357720d779b49d1f1685"><span>内娱</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0be264525864db9d0ad81" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0be264525864db9d0ad81"><span>AI陪伴</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686ce1a793fd2d72b8222fe8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686ce1a793fd2d72b8222fe8"><span>创业</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>作为听众，喜欢</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast-topic/6543c59bde390991a49b7d5f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast-topic/6543c59bde390991a49b7d5f"><span>陆小凤系列</span></a><span>、半佛仙人的“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d73b66b6c9256aee245b38" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d73b66b6c9256aee245b38"><span>再去开店我是狗</span></a><span>”、年末总结的很多期</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60502e253c92d4f62c2a9577" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60502e253c92d4f62c2a9577"><span>十字路口Crossing</span></a><span> 的 Koji</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>比我优秀的人还比我努力，远远地驰骋到我连车尾灯都看不到，钦佩！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62382c1103bea1ebfffa1c00" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62382c1103bea1ebfffa1c00"><span>半拿铁</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fab418a84a0461faa3c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e280fab418a84a0461faa3c"><span>三五环</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60449db08e2ff7878d57cff5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60449db08e2ff7878d57cff5"><span>空杯子</span></a><span> 的 刘飞</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>给我种草了好多节目！</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691c1b6ccbba038b4219c884" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691c1b6ccbba038b4219c884"><span>印象派</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690b80e5b0bdc24d1d407765" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690b80e5b0bdc24d1d407765"><span>空杯子第15期</span></a><span>、日坛公园</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bdb3a497178f08eebfb71e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bdb3a497178f08eebfb71e"><span>第732期</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>曳尾于涂“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c1b3bc3b2a2f334c55471" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c1b3bc3b2a2f334c55471"><span>凶手不在现场</span></a><span>”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>声东击西“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6853fc0db3d7fd80a40cb5ee" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6853fc0db3d7fd80a40cb5ee"><span>逃离德黑兰</span></a><span>”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>谐星聊天会“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da90d4dd11f9c8c1af0ab2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67da90d4dd11f9c8c1af0ab2"><span>百灵鸟穿花布裙</span></a><span>”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61358d971c5d56efe5bcb5d2" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61358d971c5d56efe5bcb5d2"><span>乱翻书</span></a><span> 的 潘乱</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>苏慧伦那段让我发现理性写字的人也要带感性的一面，很动人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2642">44:02</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e4515bd418a84a046e2b11a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e4515bd418a84a046e2b11a"><span>文化有限</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/661b51a136e8d0ca6230c0ab" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/661b51a136e8d0ca6230c0ab"><span>那么问题来了</span></a><span> 的 超哥</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693759aadac38001e4f8fe80" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693759aadac38001e4f8fe80"><span>安娜 · 卡列尼娜</span></a><span>”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693016e13fec3166cf1162a3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693016e13fec3166cf1162a3"><span>都是她的错</span></a><span>”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>关于做播客的复盘好真诚</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4114">01:08:34</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/636669d51064cb55f31505fc" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/636669d51064cb55f31505fc"><span>脑放电波</span></a><span> 的 Nixon</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>竟然在不知道潘乱老师也在本期节目的前提下，表白了乱翻书的节目 —— “</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68da4371522b40626cd0d679" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68da4371522b40626cd0d679"><span>穿上外卖服，我成了城市里最自由的隐形人</span></a><span>”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4429">01:13:49</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/646f194853a5e5ea1408d97c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/646f194853a5e5ea1408d97c"><span>此话当真</span></a><span> 的 Yusen</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Yusen的表达能力真好，几乎不用剪辑……是不是上播客节目锻炼出来的哈哈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>推荐了</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d2ceb38dcc57c641a7d0f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d2ceb38dcc57c641a7d0f"><span>张小珺采访张祥雨</span></a><span>的节目</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>??:??:?? </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eae66d1418a84a046472b4d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5eae66d1418a84a046472b4d"><span>基本无害</span></a><span> 的 毛冬</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>他理解成微信文字回复了……给我发了一篇小作文，所以遗憾缺席本期节目</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我来部分传达一下，有缘人自会看见：今年的新认知在基本无害</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe0d2f083a71a4eb4efbb8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe0d2f083a71a4eb4efbb8"><span>178</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692826b1cf0deb51a00d66b8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692826b1cf0deb51a00d66b8"><span>180</span></a><span>两期（ps. 我听了，深以为然），对基本无害的听众们说一句话的话，会说——有眼光</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>??:??:?? </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ff91ac8137e50a11abf569b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ff91ac8137e50a11abf569b"><span>冲浪商店</span></a><span> 的 诺亚、阿水、那爷、东东</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在他们自己单独的节目里，指路</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69909d3c18be3cd001938971" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69909d3c18be3cd001938971"><span>163期</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>以上排名按照我回收的先后顺序。</span></p><span></span><p><span>{音乐} BEA - Born to be alive</span></p>]]></description>
