  <item>
    <title>#11 与AI相伴的2024：两个播客的补丁、一些感想和回顾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6777ebcd1e823e72d301938e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6777ebcd1e823e72d301938e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jan 2025 14:08:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>应该不会有人理解成与爱相伴的2024吧……没有那种F人的东西哈哈哈。抱歉这期音质不太好，下次还是得用话筒，三星这个小破折叠，拍视频不好看就算了，没想到录音也很是劈叉……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:00:59</a> 本期节目概要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">00:01:39</a> “</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66778d74d3fc5dd62759ba5f" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66778d74d3fc5dd62759ba5f"><span>十字路口</span></a><span>”的补丁：AI PM怎么看论文？视觉类AI的算法和设计师有哪些类型？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">00:04:57</a> “</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0dcdd4525864db9d10a74" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e0dcdd4525864db9d10a74"><span>Onboard!</span></a><span>”的补丁：随着技术进步，AI陪伴类产品可能会有哪些发展？顺着思考的，没有往大突破的方向想（也很难随便就想出来啊）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">00:12:15</a> 2024工作感触一：在AI行业，想清楚是一种奢侈（但又特别关键）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">00:12:30</a> 2024工作感触二：养家糊口式创业和go big or go home式创业</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">00:13:54</a> 聊聊Meta Rayban</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">00:16:49</a> 聊聊爆款</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">00:21:32</a> 聊聊Google的几个小产品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">00:23:02</a> 聊聊画布式交互</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">00:24:41</a> 聊聊AI写代码</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">00:26:14</a> 聊聊2024年的一个令人失望的产品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1621">00:27:01</a> 我想看到的AI产品：猫语狗语翻译器和全民传记</span></p><p><span>{片头曲} 冷到YouTube都没有录音棚版的一首歌，只有听同一个播客的人能对上暗号</span></p><p><span>{封面} 我用AI生成的一张图，在星绘被浏览近百万了</span></p>]]></description>
